{"action":"command","completed_at_ns":1785239612735006667,"correlation_complete":true,"ok":true,"public_request":{"action":"command","request_id":"req-a94e9aa1856f4528b20cad1523839c27","schema":"maude.synthetic-operator.public-cli-request.v1","text":"help","timeout_seconds":35.0},"public_request_sha256":"6a86dea388edde727d1907949140bd5cb18c56354678a65d5f139f18f46d236e","public_response":{"action":"command","ok":true,"output":"Available commands:\n  plan <text>   - Start planning (freeform)\n  plan architecture / arch - Load architecture template\n  plan product / product design - Load product design template\n  plan requirements / reqs - Load requirements template\n  clear template - Unload the current template\n  lock spec     - Lock the current spec (submits constraint to governor)\n  build         - Switch to BUILD mode (creates v2 run)\n  show spec     - Show the current spec draft\n  run <plan.md> - Run a plan file (checks it, then starts a supervised run)\n  diff          - Show changes (a run's edits, or the current blocked item)\n  apply/promote - Keep changes (a run's edits, or proceed past a block with an\noverride)\n  rollback/reject - Discard changes (revert a run's edits, or fix a blocked\nitem)\n  why           - Explain what's blocked, with the policy detail\n  status        - Show governor status\n  sessions      - List all sessions (also: ls, list sessions)\n  switch <id>   - Switch to a session by ID or #N (also: session <id>, resume\n<id>)\n  delete session <id> - Delete a session (also: rm session <id>)\n\nSupervised agent sessions:\n  supervised launch         - Launch a supervised Claude session\n  supervised list                 - List supervised sessions\n  supervised events <id>          - Show session events\n  supervised interventions <id>   - Show pending approvals\n  supervised approve <id> <tcid>  - Approve a tool call\n  supervised deny <id> <tcid>     - Deny a tool call\n  supervised kill <id>            - Kill a session\n  supervised promotion <id>       - Show a run's pending changes (changed files)\n  supervised diff <id>            - Show unified diff of changes\n  supervised keep <id>            - Accept a run's changes (also: promote)\n  supervised discard <id>         - Revert a run's changes (also: reject)\n  supervised fork <id>      - Fork new session from promoted parent\n\n  snapshot / overview / wtf       - Operator snapshot (what's happening now?)\n  context / ctx / usage           - Context window usage breakdown\n  clear / reset                   - Start fresh session, reclaim context tokens\n  lineage / branch                - Where am I? Parent chain, children, siblings\n  lineage tree                    - Full session fork tree\n  history / log                   - Recent message history (last 20)\n\nQuick supervised loop:\n  go <task>     - Launch a supervised session (short for 'supervised launch')\n  y / yes       - Approve next pending tool call\n  n / deny      - Deny next pending tool call\n  p / pending   - Show pending interventions\n  (interventions auto-appear when a supervised session is active)\n\n  help / ?      - Show this help\n  anything else → sent to model via governor","request_id":"req-a94e9aa1856f4528b20cad1523839c27","restart_count":0,"schema":"maude.synthetic-operator.response.v1","screen_evidence":"screens/0001.svg","screen_sha256":"bdbe45be7c0ef26f29007d606eccc18c49b31cf3475e73ea98a9f0a87fa3d680"},"public_response_sha256":"dc332b4c9c3361729065a0a7c2f576ea01501a0e4ef76de8117bbbe88a0c063d","queue_request_file":"01785239612469458426-req-a94e9aa1856f4528b20cad1523839c27.json","queue_request_retained":false,"queue_request_sha256":"b9071de5724d839f078246c3fa3c5737c97062d3e9189ba7b6587b126aba5b40","queue_response_file":"01785239612469458426-req-a94e9aa1856f4528b20cad1523839c27.json","queue_response_observed_at_return":true,"queue_response_sha256":"bd0b21e379c835754e11728a7ac74318ac5bd0921b567a1104c5b1c9b44dfe0f","received_at_ns":1785239612469324725,"request_id